  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bende Potato Production and Marketing Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Food Crops - Potatoes., Beneficiaries: 87 smallholder farmers; of whom 40 are women., The Greenwood Potato Capacity Building Project will assist the Greenwood Farmers&apos; Cooperative to establish sufficient business systems and strengthen internal controls; including corporate governance training, financial management and business management training. The USADF grant will help Greenwood to establish stronger business policies and procedures. Greenwood will also increase productivity through trainings in crop management, farm planning and management. Membership will be increased under the project through the provision of farmer training and increased working capital for inputs. USADF funds will be provided for technical assistance, training, production inputs, business plan development and administrative support.,</narrative>
  </description>
